d their cursed employees wander the halls as monsters. You play an unpaid intern working in Neo-Cascadia, a dystopian city, whose job is to descend into these ruins, defeat the monsters and repossess the company's assets, using office junk as weapons.\n\nThe procedurally generated dungeons are each themed on a type of failed startup, such as gig work, dating sites and cryptocurrency, and the humor in Going Under pokes fun at tech hype. Single-player with full controller support, it suits players who enjoy action-oriented dungeon runs with a comedic voice."}}